recurrent adenocarcinoma of the endometrium with pelvic exenteration", "abstract": "Women with recurrent endometrial 
carcinoma are usually not considered candidates for pelvic exenteration. To assess the efficacy of this procedure, the 
records of all patients undergoing pelvic exenteration for adenocarcinoma of the endometrium at four institutions from 
