adriamycin (50 mg/m² bolus iv every 3 weeks to a maximum of 550 mg/m²) or cyclophosphamide (666 mg/m² bolus iv every 3 
weeks). Treatment was given for≥ 6 weeks, but if progression occurred or the patient received a maximal dose of 
