│ progestational or radiation therapy, or age. Grade of tumor and performance status did affect response, although 44  │
│ of 57 objective responders had undifferentiated tumors. The two combinations achieved response rapidly, required     │
│ careful supervision, and were especially useful in treating patients with usually poor prognostic features."},       │
│ {"study_index": 11, "title": "Extracting summary statistics to perform meta‐analyses of the published literature for │
