│ {"study_index": 24, "title": "Doxorubicin versus doxorubicin and cisplatin in endometrial carcinoma: definitive      │
│ results of a randomised study (55872) by the EORTC‐GCCG", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Combination chemotherapy yields    │
